# Line endings.
#
# The WordPress Coding Standards ruleset enforces LF, and CI runs on Linux,
# so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true used to fail `composer phpcs`
# locally on files that were perfectly fine in the repository. Pinning eol=lf
# makes the working tree match what CI sees.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files, so Git never tries to translate or diff them as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.mo   binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Treat these as text but keep diffs readable.
*.pot text
*.po  text
*.svg text
